  "description": "PLEASE NOTE THIS PROERTY IS LOCATED OVER 1 HOUR'S DRIVE FROM GALWAY CITY.\n\nThis fine detached 3 bedroom property is available immediately.\n\nThis attractive bungalow is spacious throughout and ideally located 5 mins drive from Williamstown, 7 mins drive from Glenamaddy and 30 mins drive from Tuam.\nSituated in a quiet tranquil countryside setting, this property will appeal to those looking for a cosy and comfortable property whilst enjoying the peaceful surrounds of the area.\n\nAccommodation comprises; Entrance hall, Sitting room, Living room, Kitchen/Dining area, Utility, Bathroom and 3 Double Bedrooms (master ensuite). \nStorage shed at the rear.\nBeautiful manicured gardens surround the property.\n\nHeating is by means of oil central heating.\n\nDeposit: €1500\nStricitly no pets permitted.\n\nEircode - F45 VH51\n\nReferences are essential showing a minimum of 12 months of continuous tenancy.\n\nPlease register your interest today by contacting our office by email ONLY.",
